  "notes": "DOUBT: medicaid.alabama.gov refuses connections from this network (TCP timeout / ECONNREFUSED, also via WebFetch), so the official PDF was taken from an unaltered Wayback Machine capture (id_ raw mode) of the official URL, captured 2026-06-16. The fee schedule page itself could not be loaded, so it is not confirmed that no newer dental edition was posted after mid-2026 (the Wayback index of the fee-schedule folder shows 10-1-25 as the most recent dental file). 'Allowed Amount' column used; single schedule; Alabama Medicaid dental benefits are for recipients under 21 (adults generally not covered), hence key 'child'. Multiple rows per code are benefit-limit audits with the same amount. Codes listed with Requires PA = Y include D4341, D4355, D4910, D5110-D5214, D6240-D6750, D7240, D7241, D8080, D8680. D8080 = 1000 (comprehensive ortho, PA). Provider alert: D0999 'Dental Participation Payment' $10 per date of service from 10/1/2025 (not included). Every fee for the requested codes is identical to the 05/01/2024 edition.",
